```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>FoodLens | Food Heroes</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <header class="navbar">

        <div class="logo">
            🍎 FoodLens
        </div>

        <nav>
            <a href="#">Home</a>
            <a href="#">Food Heroes</a>
            <a href="#">Food School</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="xp">
            ⭐ 240 XP
        </div>

    </header>


    <!-- HERO -->
    <main>

        <section class="hero">

            <div class="hero-text">

                <span class="small-title">
                    🥕 WELCOME, FOOD EXPLORER!
                </span>

                <h1>
                    Meet your
                    <span>Food Heroes</span>
                    & Sometimes Guests!
                </h1>

                <p>
                    Food isn't about good or bad.
                    Let's discover what different foods
                    do inside your body!
                </p>

                <button class="start-btn">
                    🚀 Start Exploring
                </button>

            </div>


            <div class="hero-character">

                <div class="character-circle">
                    🥦
                </div>

                <div class="speech">
                    "Ready to learn?"
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- FOOD CHARACTER SECTION -->

        <section class="characters">

            <div class="section-heading">

                <span>🧠 FOOD SCHOOL</span>

                <h2>
                    Who's on your food team?
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Some foods help your body in amazing ways.
                    Others are best enjoyed sometimes.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="character-grid">


                <!-- PALM OIL -->

                <article class="character-card guest">

                    <div class="character-top">

                        <div class="character-icon">
                            🦹‍♂️
                        </div>

                        <span class="badge">
                            SOMETIMES GUEST
                        </span>

                    </div>

                    <h3>
                        Meet Palm Oil
                    </h3>

                    <p class="character-line">
                        "I'm not exactly the villain..."
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Palm oil is a type of fat.
                        Your body needs some fat, but
                        having lots of saturated fat regularly
                        isn't the best idea.
                    </p>

                    <div class="lesson">

                        <strong>💡 FoodLens Tip</strong>

                        <p>
                            It's about <b>how much</b> and
                            <b>how often</b> — not fear!
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <button class="learn-btn">
                        🔎 Learn about Palm Oil
                    </button>

                </article>


                <!-- SUGAR -->

                <article class="character-card sugar">

                    <div class="character-top">

                        <div class="character-icon">
                            🍬
                        </div>

                        <span class="badge">
                            SWEET TRICKSTER
                        </span>

                    </div>

                    <h3>
                        Added Sugar
                    </h3>

                    <p class="character-line">
                        "I'm REALLY good at hiding!"
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Too much added sugar can sneak
                        into drinks and snacks without
                        you noticing.
                    </p>

                    <div class="lesson">

                        <strong>💡 Detective Tip</strong>

                        <p>
                            Check the nutrition label
                            before you grab a snack!
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <button class="learn-btn">
                        🔎 Find the Sugar
                    </button>

                </article>


                <!-- SODIUM -->

                <article class="character-card sodium">

                    <div class="character-top">

                        <div class="character-icon">
                            🧂
                        </div>

                        <span class="badge">
                            SNEAKY ONE
                        </span>

                    </div>

                    <h3>
                        Sodium
                    </h3>

                    <p class="character-line">
                        "You might not even notice me!"
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Your body needs sodium,
                        but getting too much regularly
                        isn't great for your health.
                    </p>

                    <div class="lesson">

                        <strong>💡 Detective Tip</strong>

                        <p>
                            Compare similar foods and
                            look at their sodium!
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <button class="learn-btn">
                        🔎 Hunt for Sodium
                    </button>

                </article>


                <!-- FIBRE -->

                <article class="character-card hero-card">

                    <div class="character-top">

                        <div class="character-icon">
                            🦸‍♂️
                        </div>

                        <span class="badge">
                            FOOD HERO
                        </span>

                    </div>

                    <h3>
                        Fibre
                    </h3>

                    <p class="character-line">
                        "I'm here for your gut!"
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Fibre helps support healthy
                        digestion and can help you
                        feel full.
                    </p>

                    <div class="lesson">

                        <strong>⭐ Hero Power</strong>

                        <p>
                            Whole grains, fruits,
                            vegetables and legumes
                            can provide fibre.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <button class="learn-btn">
                        💪 Discover Fibre
                    </button>

                </article>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- PALM OIL SPOTLIGHT -->

        <section class="spotlight">

            <div class="spotlight-character">
                🦹‍♂️
            </div>

            <div class="spotlight-content">

                <span class="small-title">
                    🔍 FOOD DETECTIVE MISSION
                </span>

                <h2>
                    Is Palm Oil REALLY a villain?
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Not quite! 😄
                </p>

                <p>
                    Palm oil isn't automatically a "bad food".
                    The bigger lesson is that foods can contain
                    different types of fat, and eating large
                    amounts of saturated fat regularly isn't ideal.
                </p>

                <div class="mission-box">

                    <span>🎯 YOUR MISSION</span>

                    <h3>
                        Find the ingredient list!
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Can you spot palm oil in a packaged food?
                    </p>

                </div>

                <button class="mission-btn">
                    🕵️ Start Mission
                </button>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- XP SECTION -->

        <section class="progress">

            <div>

                <span class="small-title">
                    🏆 YOUR FOOD JOURNEY
                </span>

                <h2>
                    Food Explorer Level 4
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Keep learning to unlock new characters!
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="progress-right">

                <div class="level">
                    ⭐ 240 / 300 XP
                </div>

                <div class="progress-bar">
                    <div></div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>

    </main>


    <!-- FOOTER -->

    <footer>

        <div>
            <strong>🍎 FoodLens</strong>
            <p>
                Learn your food. Understand your choices.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <a href="#">About</a>
            <a href="#">Food School</a>
            <a href="#">Privacy</a>
        </div>

    </footer>

</body>
</html>
```
